	"description": {
		"ja": [
			"武器も戦略もカスタマイズ!!",
			"コアユニットをベースに戦略的にカスタム可能な、「bEXM-15 ポルタノヴァ」の装備に最適なオプションウェポンが商品化。",
			"• コアユニット2種が各1個づつ付属。",
			"• 射撃武器として組み換え可能な「中型ビームライフル」「ガトリングガン」パーツの他、近接武器として組み換え可能な「アックス」「ナイフ」「ランス」のパーツが付属。"
		],
		"en": [
			"Customize your weapons and strategies!!",
			"An optional weapon that can be strategically customized based on the core unit and is ideal for equipping the \"bEXM-15 Portanova\" has been commercialized.",
			"• Two types of core units are included, one each.",
			"• In addition to the \"medium beam rifle\" and \"Gatling gun\" parts that can be recombined as shooting weapons, parts for the \"axe\", \"knife\", and \"lance\" that can be recombined as melee weapons are included."
		]
	},
